  "details": "I started up VRChat for the first time on my new phone.\n\nRight away, i opened the (small) menu and tried to set up my wings the usual way: switched the right wing to Avatars, but there was no option for the \"recently used\" avatars view that i normally use - understandable, given that i haven't previously used any on this device.\n\nWhen i changed the avatar to something else and retried, the category was there, however i was unable to choose it in the small menu wing. It worked correctly in the big menu wing though, but that didn't sync with the small menu (is that a separate bug?).\n\nAfter i exited the VRC world back to the app and rejoined, it worked fine.\n\nTiny bug that effectively resolves itself, but it may be someone's first experience with VRC :')",
